EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Here bright and early, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
You musta traveled quite a bit in
the snow,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Une visite matinale, {{TAG:0005:0000:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Cette neige ne t'a pas refroidi{{TAG:000E:0006:000002006500}} à ce
que je vois, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Me alegro de verte{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
La nieve es muy habitual en esta
época del año. ¡Disfrútala!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ehi, che piacere{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Benvenut{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} nel nostro fantastico
mondo delle nevi.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Freddo da matti,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
ma ne vale la pena.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mira quién se ha pasado a verme:{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡{{TAG:0005:0000:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Veo que la nieve no
enfría la admiración que me tienes.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma guarda un po' chi si vede.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
C'è {{TAG:0005:0000:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Copriti bene sai, più
tardi farà un freddo apocalittico!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bak kim kasabaya yuvarlanıp gelmiş.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu gece ayaz olacak, sıcak
