ES:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¡¿Cómo?! ¿{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Perdona, este frío me está
helando los párpados.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Gah! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Sen misin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Pardon. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Tabii ki sen olduğunu biliyordum!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Beynim soğuktan donuyor galiba.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Chi va là?! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Aspetta, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}sei {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
